{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5f32ba011dec6529bbc1ceed680e79ea05319c058208018378de4c083a27f584", "ja": "瑞希、お疲れさま。ブログ読んだよ。\n新曲も公演も、ファンの人達に好評だったみたいだ。", "zh": "瑞希，辛苦了。我看了你的博客。\n新歌和公演似乎都很受粉丝们的好评。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "6d93e4d029da6f113618e247cbebcd754be6b1afaacd59e2e2c5aab79763152c", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nみなさんが楽しんでくれて、良かったです。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n大家能喜欢，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "06c17758a9cd9b00e608f4814cb4971ac3a37fde750cbfa159febb28f3ace0fe", "ja": "参考までに、どんな評判か、聞かせてください。\n……ほめられたいぞ。", "zh": "作为参考，能告诉我大家是怎么评价的吗？\n……我也想被夸奖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d80b36ec1ca6470d853d60e3d836c5c1397608b5b72fc3081d7c6c7d916fd909", "ja": "そうだな、カッコイイっていうのが多いかな？\n新曲のイメージがあったからだと思うけど……。", "zh": "确实，很多人都说很帅吧？\n我想，应该是因为有新歌的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1004_p", "source_sha256": "baac6c4c14d090f188b764b28ab310a3f58e8069b63eafa32b5afa66f61e215e", "ja": "ブログにも、そういうコメントが多かったし。\n瑞希の新しい一面、ちゃんと届いたみたいだな。", "zh": "博客上也有很多这样的评论。\n看来瑞希全新的一面，确实传达给大家了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "0eff8fefeafdf395a08059083dec62779f3c6c03084815f4456fcec6a0230de0", "ja": "なるほど、カッコイイですか。\n……べいびー、近付くとヤケドするぜ。", "zh": "原来如此，觉得很帅吗。\n……小宝贝，靠近了可是会被灼伤的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "7c481318757e83db4671855366464d56fc4c7aaee1c06d9dfc69bdce2e6e72b1", "ja": "どうですか、{$P$}。\nカッコイイですか？", "zh": "怎么样，{$P$}。\n很帅气吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1007_p", "source_sha256": "de7dca67ba273a3b1debdb3bad25d0670ab321e443db2e87592039420bb4cb07", "ja": "いや、無理にいつもカッコよくしなくても……\nカッコイイは瑞希の魅力のひとつでしかないというか。", "zh": "不，倒也不用勉强自己一直保持帅气……\n帅气应该说只是瑞希众多魅力中的一种吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1008_p", "source_sha256": "18af14e69fb21296ba479a864b95d0ecc0449ab8ee9974491164c99627045b95", "ja": "今見えているもの以外にも、瑞希にはたくさんの\n魅力が眠っているはずなんだ。原石っていうのかな。", "zh": "除了现在看到的这些，瑞希身上应该还沉睡着许多魅力。该说是未经雕琢的璞玉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "ed6c34d36a357bd80abbdbab038d10ef60dc36086b64bfee763e5a0dd782e1e6", "ja": "原石、ですか。", "zh": "是指璞玉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1010_p", "source_sha256": "acfb75346fa9b3c0d7b8391acd5f97ed6f7d688274e4c82954852dc0a273db37", "ja": "ああ。だからこれからも、瑞希の色んな魅力を\n見つけていこう。そのために俺がいるんだからな！", "zh": "嗯。所以今后也要继续发掘瑞希各种各样的魅力。正因为如此，我才会在这里啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "140152bc14e83ec25017d80efc0caecbf7871f241401bbd1dd20f17d5550ff97", "ja": "わかりました、{$P$}。これからも、\n私の知らない私の魅力を、引き出してください。", "zh": "我知道了，{$P$}。今后也请您\n继续发掘出那些连我自己都不知道的魅力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "c8077a4cdd6b65526e4ffeb276a4289d4e9627a6a19bbff2b818068fa0e6e684", "ja": "原石。……斜めに切ったら、光るでしょうか。\nこう、スパッと。", "zh": "原石。……斜着切开的话，会发光吗？\n就像这样，唰地一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ab4c0d47a0aae6b0085a9faaad590eb46c294fc41a16d463dbf9ddd0c5b4dde5", "ja": "いや、そういう事では……\nまあとにかく、任されたよ。これからもよろしく！", "zh": "不，不是这个意思……  \n总之，交给我吧。今后也请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_050_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "2930c54b63932075db64af82d40ad533dcc0eef44db54742e66d0e6e37affc8b", "ja": "はい。よろしくお願いします、\n{$P$}。", "zh": "好的。今后还请多多关照，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
